---
name: coding-task
description: Initial user turn for a governed coding task.
inputs:
  task_id: {type: string}
  title: {type: string}
  description: {type: string}
  stage_context_block: {type: string, default: ""}
  session_context_block: {type: string, default: ""}
  steering_block: {type: string, default: ""}
---
Task {{ task_id }}: {{ title }}

{{ description }}{% if stage_context_block %}

Workflow stage contract:
{{ stage_context_block }}{% endif %}{% if steering_block %}

Developer steering received during this session:
{{ steering_block }}{% endif %}{% if session_context_block %}

Context from prior runs in this durable session:
{{ session_context_block }}{% endif %}
